WEBVTT

00:09:56.579 --> 00:10:01.579
as potentially improving or protecting
us a little bit more seriously.

00:10:02.371 --> 00:10:06.537
Do you think even when
the pandemic is over,

00:10:07.121 --> 00:10:12.871
that we are going to be forever changed
in some ways with our relationship to

00:10:12.871 --> 00:10:15.996
our homes and to endorse spaces?

00:10:16.454 --> 00:10:19.287
I think so. I hope so. I mean,

00:10:19.287 --> 00:10:22.912
Six Feet is really a proxy for
us to get more air flow.

00:10:23.371 --> 00:10:24.787
And with that understanding,

00:10:24.787 --> 00:10:29.162
we start to see at least I have started
to see buildings really

00:10:29.162 --> 00:10:32.037
as breathing machines,
as lungs themselves.